email":"info@360pano.de","name":"Brainbug01"},"message":"fix: ''+'' on a folder creates the preset in the root instead of the folder\n\nPresetsTree declares onCreatePreset as (parentId: string) => void and\ncalls it with a single argument, but App.onCreatePreset has the signature\n(isFromCurrentSelection: boolean, parentId?: string).\n\nThe folder id therefore arrived in the first parameter while parentId\nstayed undefined, so the new preset was created as echarts.0.preset_1\ninstead of echarts.0.<folder>.preset_1.\n\nThe mismatch went unnoticed because src-editor is only built with vite\n(esbuild strips types without checking them) and linted - tsc never runs\nover it. tsc --noEmit on src-editor reports 0 errors both before and\nafter this change, so adding it to CI would be cheap and would have\ncaught this.\n\nTested on ioBroker: creating a preset via the folder''s ''+'' button now\nplaces it inside that folder.","tree":{"sha":"eee2ec04d8c7190bbb99e9d79f73f0459f8e949f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/git/trees/eee2ec04d8c7190bbb99e9d79f73f0459f8e949f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/git/commits/f312fea73d7439b61ff86654555765ecd9d76548","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35106961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brainbug01","id":35106961,"login":"Brainbug01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA2OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commit/f312fea73d7439b61ff86654555765ecd9d76548","node_id":"C_kwDOETYo6toAKGYzMTJmZWE3M2Q3NDM5YjYxZmY4NjY1NDU1NTc2NWVjZDlkNzY1NDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commit/df0ae559ccfa2baba9b0b983f6242910004ce693","sha":"df0ae559ccfa2baba9b0b983f6242910004ce693","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commits/df0ae559ccfa2baba9b0b983f6242910004ce693"}],"sha":"f312fea73d7439b61ff86654555765ecd9d76548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commits/f312fea73d7439b61ff86654555765ecd9d76548"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/co