l":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brainbug01","id":35106961,"login":"Brainbug01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA2OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commits/56887b3b996d23f99160c80fb2c19f4ef0c173a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:29:32Z","email":"info@360pano.de","name":"Brainbug01"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T06:29:32Z","email":"info@360pano.de","name":"Brainbug01"},"message":"fix: server-side rendering never finishes, callers hang until timeout\n\nrenderImage() creates either a canvas (png/jpg/pdf) or a div root (svg),\nnever both. The guard after that if/else required root AND canvas AND\nCanvasClass at the same time, so it failed for every renderer. This also\nbreaks the documented SVG-only degradation: when canvas is unavailable\nthe code falls back to SVG, but the guard still demanded a canvas.\n\nThe failure was invisible as well: the check runs inside the\nchartData.onUpdate() callback, which fires asynchronously long after the\npromise executor has returned, so the throw neither rejected the promise\nnor showed up anywhere. Callers simply never received an answer - the\npreview tab shows ''timeout'' for every preset and the log stays empty.\n\nNow only the parts the selected renderer actually needs are required, and\nthe error path rejects instead of throwing, so genuine render errors are\nreported instead of hanging.\n\nTested on ioBroker: before, every preset timed out; after, all presets\nrender again.","tree":{"sha":"f659fbba1fdf2e7bf8367e1a1d0c9b3264af8a7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/git/trees/f659fbba1fdf2e7bf8367e1a1d0c9b3264af8a7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/git/commits/56887b3b996d23f99160c80fb2c19f4ef0c173a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35106961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Brainbug01","id":35106961,"login":"Brainbug01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MTA2OTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Brainbug01","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commit/56887b3b996d23f99160c80fb2c19f4ef0c173a3","node_id":"C_kwDOETYo6toAKDU2ODg3YjNiOTk2ZDIzZjk5MTYwYzgwZmIyYzE5ZjRlZjBjMTczYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commit/4813df64be31e221bef3c6ff4309616a86da26d1","sha":"4813df64be31e221bef3c6ff4309616a86da26d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.echarts/commits/481