iew_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/commits/21f3e9179769466ecbcad21b185b07af709df9e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:45:27Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:45:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Give Service queues its own pictogram (#1926)\n\nReplaces the artwork in service-queues.svg with a new drawing: three\npeople standing in single file, the front one in the darker teal, with a\nchevron showing the direction the line moves. The file was byte-for-byte\nidentical to patients.svg, so Service queues and Patient lists showed the\nsame picture side by side in the Home left nav.\n\nPatient lists keeps the existing group of people, which fits a list of\npatients. A queue is people waiting in line for a service, so the new\ndrawing puts them in a row instead of a group.\n\nThe pictogram id, registration, export and mocks are unchanged, so apps\nusing ServiceQueuesPictogram pick up the new artwork without changes. The\ndrawing is new: only the idea of people plus a direction came from the\nCarbon \"group\" and \"player--flow\" pictograms, and no Carbon path data was\ncopied.","tree":{"sha":"63566e5a5a85943bb9e2bf0853f045574d2f966c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/trees/63566e5a5a85943bb9e2bf0853f045574d2f966c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/commits/21f3e9179769466ecbcad21b185b07af709df9e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 63566e5a5a85943bb9e2bf0853f045574d2f966c\nparent 05d49a3308d116abe5eb671a5c578d19e6a81444\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1790934327 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790934327 +0300\n\n(fix) Give Service queues its own pictogram (#1926)\n\nReplaces the artwork in service-queues.svg with a new drawing: three\npeople standing in single file, the front one in the darker teal, with a\nchevron showing the direction the line moves. The file was byte-for-byte\nidentical to patients.svg, so Service queues and Patient lists showed the\nsame picture side by side in the Home left nav.\n\nPatient lists keeps the existing group of people, which fits a list of\npatients. A queue is people waiting in line for a service, so the new\ndrawing puts them in a row instead of a group.\n\nThe pictogram id, registration, export and mocks are unchanged, so apps\nusing ServiceQueuesPictogram pick up the new artwork without changes. The\ndrawing is new: only the idea of people plus a direction came from the\nCarbon \"group\" and \"player--flow\" pictograms, and no Carbon path data was\ncopied.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqv303CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmYMQAEvsQh+t6O2MLmCgazPaFurS\nOBvSSxsM2T3CTkAkEf7SEmEeXlhhfUJqIXosCS2bmaS1aGJWSteLp+h+ng8acTLN\n8V44+baTMkHZka9vJ0cTNCT/JjZm+abkecXw8BmS7cqH8SmsYWRvSm6nOShZQdFH\nee5pXe4/F3dP35XKzFiri7q+nI17eNg85jW4oHq8bjJZp1fEmtSZ8E05PbGPYZAu\nQk/xTQiDHqBL/H+RIcbUKm+pf/PLbaDeoN/yOeVOMPfd+AiWSRW6ni2nKAYRViWw\neEL0+OiJuGSS23/6gexUwkBY5OhOTHyesskOJZgG3x/M0rSD58pNV+i86jG0butf\nmeGbt5GUVUU5YzRxyBfAEYsD3DcLAeAQ3Ah2WCcOCqDDoSlrMXvrXegSOfDBAjNE\nPROsyOhE0NCjvqfvPbmonYxkwXilkerb6kyy7J2CPlKorikjCInLpYQyQ6xLz5zC\nb0lUQWf7IgTEUd3JwZXo21R0i1yHZSyT2rCiah0umUieTvH8KI2KGeSUNfEdptZM\nhYQxTz4jDuWdea6g/6wqNn4+nJBcuDo2KRXtlYvQ8oA1HNpOCw8dgq1VkR/zEd+A\nrHp37Fpd7NA1xf+zDeKXY6Y+8hoAX9aY28ERaujj9rjIJ3geQYdvGT1N6cIUd6/o\n94k/St+oOPEicKwyafNL\n=K7ud\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-02T09:45:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"http