d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NethmiRodrigo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/commits/560f36f2ca08ed7dd6cd8aa0b43b4a25ec1ed965/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:33:43Z","email":"nethmi@openmrs.org","name":"Nethmi Rodrigo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T17:33:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Show the location picker from \"Change location\" when chooseLocation is disabled (#1908)\n\nWith chooseLocation.enabled set to false, the location picker auto-selects the first login location on mount. The header''s \"Change location\" link opens the same picker with update=true, so clicking it silently switched the session location to the first location, overwrote the user''s saved default, and navigated back without showing a list.\n\nSkip the auto-select effect in the update flow, matching the guard already used by the saved-preference effect.","tree":{"sha":"8ee4eea1e3b51052e42d51f4013e53d3df2c3f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/trees/8ee4eea1e3b51052e42d51f4013e53d3df2c3f8e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/commits/560f36f2ca08ed7dd6cd8aa0b43b4a25ec1ed965","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ee4eea1e3b51052e42d51f4013e53d3df2c3f8e\nparent 5707d73a68669dcef4683c30ee8bf84042460ea1\nauthor Nethmi Rodrigo <nethmi@openmrs.org> 1790616823 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790616823 +0300\n\n(fix) Show the location picker from \"Change location\" when chooseLocation is disabled (#1908)\n\nWith chooseLocation.enabled set to false, the location picker auto-selects the first login location on mount. The header''s \"Change location\" link opens the same picker with update=true, so clicking it silently switched the session location to the first location, overwrote the user''s saved default, and navigated back without showing a list.\n\nSkip the auto-select effect in the update flow, matching the guard already used by the saved-preference effect.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquqT4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAR44QAJPS7fHRqxgSxJ+SsbwEwGji\nPUkBoHFYJ2XEXQHJMFB5wLxpFT5ghh+qNqCmuQn7v0ErvI4zsJxJmHaParESbAr8\ngSFGa/2K7ab7kjyskXU+LFqbBIM51IcvjfeZ/YqcROzvECkSH9OBaKXCzaNPkAcN\n2pLjEuYDxCCivRcE+sL1uzhj+gSwNduwKWwM/savRkSKHP3DJZiXBKDTRZtXJ055\nnkWrUs2UC1kBOoL5fD5jIybd+g+Ynp2Wh5Err81O7MVRshdUUQE/Fw4Ai1EGqsS7\nYZYLKpAFGCsdPgjyywIX6RIpwxXaBBfCOqaYuf+z99tDv2cAkWevLxXoHQh0glP1\nyTfCH+T73jhRebBiPSfAFZ5RzsXx780OiiGDs8491K0oKnEs78tCNBx/rcyvOMyg\nyciE/gvWNHcwBRXWXrj/G09LE7wssqD6rHJVotRJGwHkymzY1L+NygF0IYAFqGKC\ngWFk2GrpW/38K+/1WNkIEGtHUw2qhmG3xomm5pdd3Oa8a0qtnS0iUkLkGA88yXq6\n9Pd0K5mxDKwJsFNCcShxFUFZ5COMgpD2IAIg8+eHqDHTaLtYSx68WiD1R/GPXV/K\nbxbSqgnPXxLm0V+f5B8k9lfJVIwCNpTNd2g+n//mI1vc3378kmk8xbBwkNC64Tmr\nOW42pTNBA91JbqLnKFBR\n=qlNb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T17:33:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user