gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T19:49:41Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"message":"(fix) Fix invalid JSON in the markdown link check config\n\n4a76a0c added \"aliveStatusCodes\" without a trailing comma, so the config\nhas been invalid JSON since Aug 18. markdown-link-check exits on the\nparse error for every file. The GitHub action runs it through\n`find -exec ... ;`, which ignores the exit status, and only fails when\nthe output contains \"ERROR:\", so the docs workflow has been reporting\n\"All links are good!\" without checking any links.\n\nAdding the comma restores link checking. A local run over the same 63\nfiles CI checks finds no dead links.","tree":{"sha":"4955f738c2a3bfbad7f4482fece4ab08edcf9837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/trees/4955f738c2a3bfbad7f4482fece4ab08edcf9837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/commits/5707d73a68669dcef4683c30ee8bf84042460ea1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dennisk