ha":"8aa137ceb1785269c8c2636ac225f69dcbda3181","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/commits/8aa137ceb1785269c8c2636ac225f69dcbda3181"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8509731?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/denniskigen","id":8509731,"login":"denniskigen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1MDk3MzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/denniskigen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/commits/812a398c1eb80f280adf14885d743eb6b52fd8ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T20:16:16Z","email":"kigen.work@gmail.com","name":"Dennis Kigen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T20:16:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"(fix) Exclude the CodeSnippet copy button from the primary button override (#1821)\n\nCarbon builds the CodeSnippet copy button as a primary button (kind\nprimary, classes cds--copy-btn cds--copy cds--btn cds--btn--primary\ncds--btn--icon-only) and then repaints it with a layer background. The\nstyleguide''s global .cds--btn--primary override loads after Carbon''s\n.cds--copy-btn rule and ties it on specificity, so it won on source\norder and every CodeSnippet copy button rendered as a solid brand-teal\nprimary button instead of Carbon''s subtle layer-background icon button.\n\nExclude the copy button from the override using :not(:where(...)). The\nzero-specificity :where() keeps the override selectors at (0,1,0). A\nplain :not(.cds--copy-btn) would raise them to (0,2,0), which would\nbeat Carbon''s .cds--btn:disabled rule (0,1,1) and repaint disabled\nprimary buttons teal.\n\nVerified against the compiled styleguide CSS and the built app shell\nbundle: the copy button now gets Carbon''s layer background at rest,\nlayer-hover on hover, and Carbon''s own focus outline in both light and\ndark themes, while regular and disabled primary buttons are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"1bb6dcbc071d70848ce627ac5cdc1093e8de9142","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/trees/1bb6dcbc071d70848ce627ac5cdc1093e8de9142"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openmrs/openmrs-esm-core/git/commits/812a398c1eb80f280adf14885d743eb6b52fd8ab","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bb6dcbc071d70848ce627ac5cdc1093e8de9142\nparent 1f8595293d105e86e347fa06eec866d6e3e8246f\nauthor Dennis Kigen <kigen.work@gmail.com> 1785615376 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785615376 +0000\n\n(fix) Exclude the CodeSnippet copy button from the primary button override (#1821)\n\nCarbon builds the CodeSnippet copy button as a primary button (kind\nprimary, classes cds--copy-btn cds--copy cds--btn cds--btn--primary\ncds--btn--icon-only) and then repaints it with a layer background. The\nstyleguide''s global .cds--btn--primary override loads after Carbon''s\n.cds--copy-btn rule and ties it on specificity, so it won on source\norder and every CodeSnippet copy button rendered as a solid brand-teal\nprimary button instead of Carbon''s subtle layer-background icon button.\n\nExclude the copy button from the override using :not(:where(...)). The\nzero-specificity :where() keeps the override selectors at (0,1,0). A\nplain :not(.cds--copy-btn) would raise them to (0,2,0), which would\nbeat Carbon''s .cds--btn:disabled rule (0,1,1) and repaint disabled\nprimary buttons teal.\n\nVerified against the compiled styleguide CSS and the built app shell\nbundle: the copy button now gets Carbon''s layer background at rest,\nlayer-hover on hover, and Carbon''s own focus outline in both light and\ndark themes, while regular and disabled primary buttons are unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqblQQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALXwQALH0+GXgA3EtiKKzySCcfcTA\nNLa+HHkncgImLBcaw5Zon2ytdKpNW5XgGDUkadXUnpEQqTnkNOwKW6lQl4wySoa7\npgT+WMZYzmop2fvmznsdxo2X6FH28SSBojZ7Fhu183BuyuiDh6EMnyrQMSQqUehA\nWRudS7U6O1NYcycTT8wNxYLB7bhSe77rOnYC20yBe/T3unPpR1SeV4HmL8Gxaxym\nc48ah/pFgUhWZdL8ycCrOCOPR/pVwfJoNJfvPIfA9iFEF0CqR7QeONIzw69ZNWtQ\nk4EB2vPfKFB22RmakVlyr02XxhBWKgJQhD2uD+Q8Kp4U94p3naCFMjtWN0v6g6BI\nvg8iU836wthi4t58JluouQXCcliBfs6kSubdpoIZCnEWsCZq8QfGnURmmwTLCWTW\njBoJml0G5YQY2rCjALb366mHz2uzcbaiJkdSyJJ6zm95DrTzsbeYMW+wPbwSGYQX\nUMdS0sfOY5tWiAry5gYeH//M2ppllX9wwuS1q46aiCQusTIQ6d/hKTFaSWIMhuKn\nBn5zwjPOo+o8iDV1xXbMGndtT5BUDaugOuSaArm9F+9n3L7WA61JB/U79ihOWAbb\nNniiCC2n60b96TQP8j5M/lgWDbEXXVru9s8vQ8c/ro5luKS0Mx6uF5P/nqRzm+Yn\njZg5ecf2W4CpN88LlUGE\n=drRm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T20:16:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https:/