bertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/d0a8342cd61bbcce263fed827d4b08fba7916c83/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T05:48:38Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T05:48:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(visual-docs): adopt screencomp v0.4.8 across every consumer (#111)\n\n## What\n\nUpgrade screencomp from v0.4.5 to v0.4.8 across visual documentation\ntooling and guidance, with no changes to committed visual baselines or\nworkflow permissions.\n\n## Why\n\nKeep the site current with the visual documentation tooling used by\nother consumers on this host, while preserving the existing visual\noutput and corrected container file ownership behavior.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe installer commit now points to v0.4.8. Its installer bytes are\nidentical to v0.4.5, so the pinned SHA-256 checksum remains unchanged.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.