_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/95c7f9f2af2225d583c4d52efcc564095710d518/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:31:52Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T18:31:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(visual): reconcile the pre-push guard with the corrected screencomp scaffold (#110)\n\n## What\n\nEnsure the visual pre-push guard creates the container’s `node_modules`\nmountpoint as the invoking user before Docker starts, preventing\nroot-owned residue while preserving the repository’s adapted capture\nworkflow. Add end-to-end coverage of the complete container-user\ncontract.\n\n## Why\n\nDocker otherwise creates a missing mountpoint as root inside the working\ntree. Those files survive run cleanup, leave retained clones unusable,\nand permanently consume disk on the dispatch host.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"e3ea354b25263622573f1e8cf16ffee246a15dc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/e3ea354b25263622573f1e8cf16ffee246a15dc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/95c7f9f2af2225d583c4d52efcc564095710d518","verification":{"payload":"tree e3ea354b25263622573f1e8cf16ffee246a15dc6\nparent fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788633112 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788633112 +0000\n\nfix(visual): reconcile the pre-push guard with the corrected screencomp scaffold (#110)\n\n## What\n\nEnsure the visual pre-push guard creates the container’s `node_modules`\nmountpoint as the invoking user before Docker starts, preventing\nroot-owned residue while preserving the repository’s adapted capture\nworkflow. Add end-to-end coverage of the complete container-user\ncontract.\n\n## Why\n\nDocker otherwise creates a missing mountpoint as root inside the working\ntree. Those files survive run cleanup, leave retained clones unusable,\nand permanently consume disk on the dispatch host.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnGAYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwNoQAAMp6M6jo7VOsbc3JbyFUdIQ\n1ewSpQ89LcOW0rV0/ubMwgwkQoqOZDbwrQshZfxC4SlwEqsSTb4p65cC4I2DVxzS\nRoXA2VyJDfXAeKPaTj7EaaBNCZPxqdBXduEvD4NtLdE1Df2qR2V2lIdm+H1Z8cmN\nRBEd5E8mMp6DtYEuejsdRem/ES6GkQAx8SXop82/IPOTX4lLUFjBrfVGhtVXe76h\nvx9WuDWs9AcChyFQqd4PlnKUTX2M6GOn5qABogWTB75snSc2VhGB+uTZGunBQu9u\nUIeiEYGCfwKlgtDkNc0zRnXcsNkSaMJunHBkxHsqUrqODaAg8ikC6lxdSO0z5YQn\nqZadvp3QXQiGQ5L3Tm76cGio5QeMkHXkKVfLFzsODc2dla9mpupFSEHdPNQZ+xzZ\niDBhhuI41Z3V5QyRclzN75TFD34SuM6Cd9nGPR5BqdB0mmgwbkBjS2NJveabl5Oc\nmVHEtsqw8izC25nKuAiWxcLAaB5+wrGBVaBa7bKy1BDV3TrjvQgZzRS8DdUBKY8h\ncY/dNP/MofaT5fuTjpdg3TvGRio/nxKvXPL4e0tMSzWHxCj8kcaky9R1ZbGxUDmP\n5CRb7/2t1xX+qrOgcbGgGDchlWOiRSeACG0VgcB2oguRgqfFDoJ5BprSvuweUKrw\nk8ZW21hHoXS9fn0smsOB\n=XBOF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","ver