/api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:18:15Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T11:18:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(ssr): build the TanStack Start and Module Federation compatibility spike (#108)\n\n## What\n\nDocuments a successful build-and-browser spike proving TanStack Start\nand Module Federation can coexist in one Rsbuild remote consumed by a\nseparate host. It records the required configuration, observed plugin\ncollisions, reproducible setup, and implications for this repository’s\nstatic twelve-remote architecture.\n\n## Why\n\nThis settles the key compatibility unknown blocking a meaningful\nTanStack Start adoption decision. With integration feasibility\nestablished, the project can evaluate whether moving routing and\nrendering responsibilities to a battle-tested external library justifies\nthe migration cost.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"de75461957b99040dcb18179006daf60d60d5acd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/de75461957b99040dcb18179006daf60d60d5acd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb","verification":{"payload":"tree de75461957b99040dcb18179006daf60d60d5acd\nparent c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788175095 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788175095 +0000\n\ndocs(ssr): build the TanStack Start and Module Federation compatibility spike (#108)\n\n## What\n\nDocuments a successful build-and-browser spike proving TanStack Start\nand Module Federation can coexist in one Rsbuild remote consumed by a\nseparate host. It records the required configuration, observed plugin\ncollisions, reproducible setup, and implications for this repository’s\nstatic twelve-remote architecture.\n\n## Why\n\nThis settles the key compatibility unknown blocking a meaningful\nTanStack Start adoption decision. With integration feasibility\nestablished, the project can evaluate whether moving routing and\nrendering responsibilities to a battle-tested external library justifies\nthe migration cost.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlWL3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhBAQALChoZMZDaZ9MrTYYy0+eTlP\nST46Guep9nNg7erTBr2RMu3S/bgRcizreS4uGNO9xcrkbEDSap5Qf2sTb01hD53s\nB9A7bz+lSxnScSb5yvbZOyNowWQ10NOCPZyDjRnfEdqtBstmNdPKIQp6KzK/bmhU\nZ1ucrEYjO2ifT3JK16kKIWe+4cuyvz9WECYaZNQO1gZghLFHGWMH4jtLpWYsb7Ni\n2xyGYKuX5lym9pUKlOOvwdWK53lVANhy/eGyHW0DTwuSWYklIwcmYT6u9ij3sGzu\nvseqtjzUFk9DXKrYDuE9S8fuHtRKb+cHTv7yfDouh4X9cKsNqwGPNaj+BkETr1k7\ngDLcW2s/E/1fOnGMa+atXElThNFfmwwU3WD+5y1zlffmlxZxiqDnWImEHtPYRqiq\nK3SFAxDbOHqUSsB0sw6f/hGtm0oG/0tQAPA7nk7R0uIGvne485N27M9nuLDYqmqj\nl37DEygkw0YzFYdaGpN8Tx8PoB9FXeSjwKQ9+PWGWfe26exmDqeWH9cKfFFIK8aF\nP3SnRMd24wkAhLF74TvFlflRaKDydG2EHGk7dc2o/QguH4I9VmkQtu3AvdaOZ3ES\nizYTFXy2wR2JpUTazR2wzqs1FDCVvD2kgrzEmyFZoI+MgxjTebSGyE/XaGHd0tr6\n9Cp8HUboURi3/Qcd/biv\n=6iQw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-31T11:18:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb","node_id":"C_kwDOEVh7ZNoAKGZjNDQyMTZiOWFiZWNiMWE4MDcyODM1ZDA3OTUzMDc4YzkzZTA2YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404","sha":"c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404"}],"sha":"fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/fc44216b9abecb1a8072835d07953078c93e06bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:06:32Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T07:06:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(home): re-measure the pane hydration block and act on what the measurement says (#107)\n\n## What\n\nDocument the end-to-end measurement of Home’s hydration block and retain\nthe existing behavior. Removing the block produced an overlapping Total\nBlocking Time range, so direct entry continues hydrating prerendered\npanes without replacing painted content with skeletons.\n\n## Why\n\nThe block intentionally prevents a skeleton flash, but it can delay\ninteractivity. After the payload reductions, re-measuring the composed\nartifact confirms that removing it no longer delivers a meaningful\nperformance improvement, so preserving the smoother experience is\nwarranted.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"e7680c31e7e8977b293930e3a650412754716ff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/e7680c31e7e8977b293930e3a650412754716ff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/c38696e3fe96aab46ed727e4cad1624f5af8e404","verification":{"payload":"tree e7680c31e7e8977b293930e3a650412754716ff5\nparent 1e5404a96ff3119e4744eb4b8ec988233f824e30\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788159992 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788159992 +0000\n\nperf(home): re-measure the pane hydration block and act on what the measurement says (#107)\n\n## What\n\nDocument the end-to-end measurement of Home’s hydration block and retain\nthe existing behavior. Removing the block produced an overlapping Total\nBlocking Time range, so direct entry continues hydrating prerendered\npanes without replacing painted content with skeletons.\n\n## Why\n\nThe block intentionally prevents a skeleton flash, but it can delay\ninteractivity. After the payload reductions, re-measuring the composed\nartifact confirms that removing it no longer delivers a meaningful\nperformance improvement, so preserving the smoother experience is\nwarranted.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlSf4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIRUQAIs7J1T5tYgQlsosvxJ1O0ny\nt9AztiRudjJeku6pKpXyorPNDiVk7BeBZNJx7Je506YS5P5OyK4cu8HjhPlpq8on\n0WffBPpqnTChSMLhfcpICb7OFz9IgjTyuucoZAFmhCgg7CCbRvrJiP6kg66aaJaR\npE6cxXXuX1YdwzX96MPA6sGxlE9KSxglj5A6v+rjNCjLACsFWS2t3aq0c5aSjs+V\nv04qEI4jhmWValHn/7qyjmC9uVGxXnPeUOpqSsIwbSaWvGrfp1yB9q7vbq/iqARJ\nwN2CWF5vx0iAe+hEWynHOoGNN9XZrEIm8dy5wxcukKzmk83BlsPiKhb1jPJj0lR4\nr/1EJWmGE39ZEZixRrj1X0GjEz/gJdYi2cQaJ9UH9QmMVj5l3rSwlPXTEwwszapp\nGb6+QF1yQ5dC5QaY1MuqNNT6KL3NAiLCR6cMfZkgEDi6HB5Bqa/fl08MIP64Wzyc\nq3rnvANA+WtJ0ICkkznzhbEpIPU3NR8tH/gZOt9FMvKQTk6NoUo1sfniGa9fRWx6\nI3W7soDCeepFyQO9e1XQZmJh66T/osdZwCtJnBX9+QNEHuPjso2xW1se+RgfHlZb\njCW53S7pdc0aHMEazyrtH4BL33itwP1ZsMXgzPPHKknaQsUBFvvV2BoA2DZSV/EJ\nfX1bHKNKfw