erobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/1e5404a96ff3119e4744eb4b8ec988233f824e30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:38:32Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T06:38:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(federation): share the remaining cross-container libraries as non-eager singletons (#106)\n\n## What\n\nShares common route libraries across Module Federation containers,\neliminating duplicated payloads while preserving standalone rendering.\nThis cuts the composed Home route from 833,850 to 143,903 bytes,\nResearch from 174,981 to 32,310 bytes, and Courses from 160,442 to\n17,772 bytes.\n\n## Why\n\nThis is the largest payload reduction in issue #92—an 82% cut for the\ncomposed Home route—and the final substantive prerequisite for the\nhydration work.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f4275a0dc4ff678f9f4093c7e81f817e12dce42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/2f4275a0dc4ff678f9f4093c7e81f817e12dce42"},"ur