:"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/a95aec423cc624a2310a6493197306ceac013166/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:48:02Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T20:48:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(design-system): publish the primitives every pane reimplemented (#104)\n\n## What\n\nGive each feature a validated CV domain slice and replace duplicated\npane UI/CSS across all 12 remotes with shared design-system primitives.\nThis reduces `/` route page chunks from 3,698,118 to 833,850 bytes and\nroughly halves the composed home document’s inlined CSS while preserving\ninherited heading colors.\n\n## Why\n\nFeatures were bundling the entire CV dataset for one slice, while\nrepeated pane primitives made visual changes require edits across every\nremote and prevented shared CSS from being emitted once.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01cb4d2f370e210685a35cef6ef442ea0fcc7793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/01cb4d2f370e210685a35cef6ef442ea0fcc7793"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/a95aec423cc624a2310a6493197306ceac013166","verification":{"payload":"tree 01cb4d2f370e210685a35cef6ef442ea0fcc7793\nparent 12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788122882 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788122882 +0000\n\nrefactor(design-system): publish the primitives every pane reimplemented (#104)\n\n## What\n\nGive each feature a validated CV domain slice and replace duplicated\npane UI/CSS across all 12 remotes with shared design-system primitives.\nThis reduces `/` route page chunks from 3,698,118 to 833,850 bytes and\nroughly halves the composed home document’s inlined CSS while preserving\ninherited heading colors.\n\n## Why\n\nFeatures were bundling the entire CV dataset for one slice, while\nrepeated pane primitives made visual changes require edits across every\nremote and prevented shared CSS from being emitted once.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlJcCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6KgQADXLZCjslC9Ys1NQuZBqz6yo\nJ7FIoQupZ3oIs+90O0cyvz/wZ51ZoqPQYag3Yyjc7YXbWBMqo3ngNR8KLE80H1c5\nvXDNTQfk1x9ONXgQIiG17uUr7pamPkUZfp0XQSy4o/yiTxLC9m4aidPlPLflJiKd\nvHkSG+wSOgVEmfeWl5dBRiEacihcJ0JMuOivtOXLPnOc0NX92Ty0F46FxHIThJl7\nRmKr9TfeGxkuzeLG3TVQkU3R6xsrlwCoG/2Qp4FrRu9ILIuF/yXYhXyiF+95GYNB\nYT9iD0Ro4drDIn+vj9Rop7Rwwida+951bYwmApVVPCk2+ofJ38pg8A6FSk2FqAaa\nJ7nEyViwb/vQFfpi99U2NCTLyBLso1NZccVbvLnIDmAFmg90a76bPhYuENFtVRpg\nBXpCFOfoRoICqppTLTZUryivg28L4n0V+uKFT4V0FesbVIB7ldcR8q3r6V2+E065\ngAVqhbB3/YHJAKUooS0jqNjVXlxdxfGGt03o5pCrZ+kWvol0CirCAwweIcFJ0VNd\nA2Z4ZFMfJNWbia+uUEnYi+lfnatrHtlPq8P76e5g0vlMyb89bgUxou6gmhO3e+hS\ncPrgW4tHb5hm5ZgqVvzjPoLeaPj8cUxWSd5kqFP4OtXCVFdJohB++yI5DPUNaKYE\njELCllWK6EvI4JZ6x3lp\n=J6Tg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T20:48:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"ht