":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:16:04Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T16:16:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(data-access): give each feature its own validated CV domain slice (#103)\n\n## What\n\nFeature apps now load and validate only their own CV domain slice, with\nbundle budgets and reachability checks enforcing that separation. The\n`/` route’s `./Page` chunks drop from 3,698,118 to 833,850 bytes.\n\n## Why\n\nEach feature previously bundled the entire CV dataset to render one\nslice, unnecessarily increasing its payload.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5a535dbc44c2086272294bbc1c674f3f52b4c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/a5a535dbc44c2086272294bbc1c674f3f52b4c1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43","verification":{"payload":"tree a5a535dbc44c2086272294bbc1c674f3f52b4c1e\nparent 3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788106564 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788106564 +0000\n\nperf(data-access): give each feature its own validated CV domain slice (#103)\n\n## What\n\nFeature apps now load and validate only their own CV domain slice, with\nbundle budgets and reachability checks enforcing that separation. The\n`/` route’s `./Page` chunks drop from 3,698,118 to 833,850 bytes.\n\n## Why\n\nEach feature previously bundled the entire CV dataset to render one\nslice, unnecessarily increasing its payload.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlFdECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEFYQAAKT8hQEfNfpUxWJ04AsQp2Z\nXwgghapUoO9QJlg7uHjllJ9pZT64GjNZ+geb5xML9b0cVaNTXcSOdGTAhe24zrOL\nLgP1dnxaiXx4HWnUAa/YKLo55ODxVjpfeFSJcFI6T/4xNo9H3Jxpr2vlyN72x76F\nI/zhq9s9CtG5JtIN8MImFd8e9AkdXeyInnuT1bKRDdVdHk2LFVyVOHNqz0waGYNb\nK/RDkQhyJDF4Q460XOUaEvZQJjgLn95LTLpkOYoaKrO076trlT8Vs2vw0RkyUI2p\nLQezcZC+b/eOu2hr1iCUX9vQKWhK5W28qmzNlpN25XaA9OMd3+tzFPwNpsvumTPw\nmaqGsgS9iA8wInsVrKryr9HYvxMWoqKt0V7izlmOhBcSFjMlnrUqB2S2VIYbtr+d\ncN2BelyGi/wsmig+HiqFOd/ERK+JmZWZmYreuZsF40GnyKFZpwKtr4zvwZVitFd1\n3rUIyllGo0Qxe+7+M3KWmYT7bjdQF8uVrMi4DeuV+VVtnpUs+RHhbfB4zrGmvPwJ\nciykvG23PhD+ArwY6fQeQSbWOlT8HHTBHBFNaIivgXbl7QcewkF9+RFDYKQD9P1a\nYgiWIeh4pytrsxizts7q/r5VA8lxH1RGEWdI6QLs6rL+vCJEkfr4G17dFEuPARpy\n3dCCoDmBgViFOWbVaR9Y\n=P5B0\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-30T16:16:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43","node_id":"C_kwDOEVh7ZNoAKDEyZTE5YzliOGZjZWY2ZDJlYjYxZjM0YmMyNWRlZWE1OTdkMDZkNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360","sha":"3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360"}],"sha":"12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/12e19c9b8fcef6d2eb61f34bc25deea597d06d43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:58:55Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T14:58:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(data-access-core): keep the CV dataset, its schema, and its drift check out of the browser (#102)\n\n## What\n\nSplit CV data access into type-only, runtime-validator, and bundled-data\nsurfaces. The shell and awards now validate fetched domain slices\nwithout bundling the full CV dataset or eagerly compiling every\nvalidator, cutting the `/` route budget by roughly 1.49 MB while\npreserving payload validation and integrity checks.\n\n## Why\n\nThe federated home page was shipping and evaluating repeated copies of\nthe CV dataset in multiple containers, adding non-cacheable parsing,\nschema-compilation, and serialization work before interactivity.\nIsolating browser validation from bundled fixture data removes that\nduplicated work from the shell and awards paths.\n\n## Additional info\n\nSkills, timeline, research, software, and courses intentionally retain\nbundled data for now; moving those features to fetched domain slices is\nthe next stage.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9c6ef5755cd1f96f9bebabe2a9d2fbc320c0769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/b9c6ef5755cd1f96f9bebabe2a9d2fbc320c0769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/3e36f6aef9fcff000fb3f75fbd6f3b2013e19360","verification":{"payload":"tree b9c6ef5755cd1f96f9bebabe2a9d2fbc320c0769\nparent 1c67e3a4ba3d50b83071a81d772398ec52a5a5b4\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788101935 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788101935 +0000\n\nperf(data-access-core): keep the CV dataset, its schema, and its drift check out of the browser (#102)\n\n## What\n\nSplit CV data access into type-only, runtime-validator, and bundled-data\nsurfaces. The shell and awards now validate fetched domain slices\nwithout bundling the full CV dataset or eagerly compiling every\nvalidator, cutting the `/` route budget by roughly 1.49 MB while\npreserving payload validation and integrity checks.\n\n## Why\n\nThe federated home page was shipping and evaluating repeated copies of\nthe CV dataset in multiple containers, adding non-cacheable parsing,\nschema-compilation, and serialization work before interactivity.\nIsolating browser validation from bundled fixture data removes that\nduplicated work from the shell and awards paths.\n\n## Additional info\n\nSkills, timeline, research, software, and courses intentionally retain\nbundled data for now; moving those features to fetched domain slices is\nthe next stage.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlEUwCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAU5QQAAALJnbsWXVi5eZWG2cJAmpE\nCVi6D3kreP4rdYJlckQMW86Oaf31XORvHc2fqrNdaZ8xPvgVt8RhprXmf8GK3z5l\nYj3m2LO8XRso00z2E7v2g9de8rgyUriYbP/89DZe/mRAixYLiXvMza4C59lfJEVZ\nu3W9mivQjE+M/XdQZBHW2TrJadqB54LwT6fgBE/ruefSUmiFQoOayUyg6uHrukoO\nODY03PDBJ1wiEc4/W0nhMU/SIOTV76rF4CyYwB5HRKP1tKW6mJE8zohDoucx2KUD\nJpAPATvDjRq9zbFOWzBSibKo9js+EovTN9ez6Iv+GDKs2VxQMF9dlAxa8SZfCWYq\nC6jG7MYR8ynU8rnUvPeBUqNQsRh+goarLlQUHyPUgaYRyRxDgeffQIN8psS/RUvq\n72AQoXtlwjTEk2kkBas9U9IRwKyBjGoar8jzp65X67iYz1VbtYHje3zq1f+FcYJv\n5/qz0IF9eLz30vdN0F/fHsNQXHo146daKIl0By1mlamoxRN1HsupZv