ckderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/1c67e3a4ba3d50b83071a81d772398ec52a5a5b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:18:29Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T12:18:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(data-access-core): give siteBase its own export path and gate the artifact on bundle budgets (#100)\n\n## What\n\nMoves `siteBase` to a side-effect-free package subpath, removing the CV\ndataset from three homepage panes without changing behavior. Adds\nderived per-app and per-route bundle budgets to the prerender gate so\npayload growth or incomplete coverage fails the composed artifact.\n\n## Why\n\nThree homepage panes each shipped roughly 436 KB of CV data solely to\nread a 21-character base URL. Because that regression was measured,\ndocumented, and still shipped, the resulting payload reduction needs a\ncommitted gate that prevents the new floor from rising silently.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09f0e523fd1a28e5e4c330373058697825074a68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/09f0e523fd1a28e5e4c330373058697825074a68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/1c67e3a4ba3d50b83071a81d772398ec52a5a5b4","verification":{"payload":"tree 09f0e523fd1a28e5e4c330373058697825074a68\nparent fb99a1f18f30b68e4db725e546acaf8d76c64d5e\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788092309 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788092309 +0000\n\nperf(data-access-core): give siteBase its own export path and gate the artifact on bundle budgets (#100)\n\n## What\n\nMoves `siteBase` to a side-effect-free package subpath, removing the CV\ndataset from three homepage panes without changing behavior. Adds\nderived per-app and per-route bundle budgets to the prerender gate so\npayload growth or incomplete coverage fails the composed artifact.\n\n## Why\n\nThree homepage panes each shipped roughly 436 KB of CV data solely to\nread a 21-character base URL. Because that regression was measured,\ndocumented, and still shipped, the resulting payload reduction needs a\ncommitted gate that prevents the new floor from rising silently.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqlB+VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADxgQACQImQvs/+TJQWrMpC5a8Kt3\n6B9Q7dSuLBjtufixzVLXoBqFa+dMCa8p0SlhmoKh4B0eb876Vw60nyfQDbAEubDW\nWeJh4gdYMIC35taD5lRYbozHwGbkyD3ho2jbBacraPDsq4v5/9Vgle9xaM7UQecO\nlPW9VhsAj+j26tJd+KAo0584cOFlJiTYpOcVIuetpCkV2ySvT/bQRDqPgzpitsDg\nv4NcSsBAKcCgxDpmgK0YhA3SFQ/PttDihHiZRfDbnrFQJPS5+bKYzOP1h/3ilJd0\nqadmeY+8NGEYA8ZCL+yhHE/T1T01Q4Mf+wFqBdjnf03e7vxXHF5oX8StNKMZdnGY\nUoBNFjHPyZ/c0cnnu3o+hnZubyRBFrHg2CQFC0naPdcnISee+4Vdx62dSLJYjuz