"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/fb99a1f18f30b68e4db725e546acaf8d76c64d5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:36:15Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T08:36:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tooling): give the workspace one command surface for serving an app (#101)\n\n## What\n\nAdds `just serve-dev <app>` as the workspace’s single development\ncommand, serving one app from source with hot reload against the\nproduction-built federated graph on one origin. The supporting\nconfiguration preserves generated remote type declarations, validates\nproject manifests with actionable errors, and avoids duplicate\ncomposed-browser gate runs.\n\n## Why\n\nThe deployed home route ships 14,627 KiB of JavaScript, including\nroughly eight copies of the same CV dataset. This completes the\ndevelopment-tooling housekeeping for fixing that payload, while ensuring\na malformed project manifest is reported clearly instead of silently\nmaking an app appear unservable.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3e31525ca8f54fdfdfce1a07bbc8b68fcef7b1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/c3e31525ca8f54fdfdfce1a07bbc8b68fcef7b1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/fb99a1f18f30b68e4db725e546acaf8d76c64d5e","verification":{"payload":"tree c3e31525ca8f54fdfdfce1a07bbc8b68fcef7b1e\nparent b686bc7254090be43d6471dde36d79d53a64760f\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788078975 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788078975 +0000\n\nfeat(tooling): give the workspace one command surface for serving an app (#101)\n\n## What\n\nAdds `just serve-dev <app>` as the workspace’s single development\ncommand, serving one app from source with hot reload against the\nproduction-built federated graph on one origin. The supporting\nconfiguration preserves generated remote type declarations, validates\nproject manifests with actionable errors, and avoids duplicate\ncomposed-browser gate runs.\n\n## Why\n\nThe deployed home route ships 14,627 KiB of JavaScript, including\nroughly eight copies of the same CV dataset. This completes the\ndevelopment-tooling housekeeping for fixing that payload, while ensuring\na malformed project manifest is reported clearly instead of silently\nmaking an app appear unservable.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqk+t/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoPIQABOIokp4w9dU1PWmrv/yIp7S\nRLwB6Q+wLaI/dHNENqQ/F3s67K/GCny34pVm1ykKPD92lF9w4tc4yzfVRx1dSU2e\n2mkP00BCmX3hveJYiUF2JvNR6U