ng guard.\n\n## Why\n\nThe ownership mismatch was refusing publication across unrelated\nworkstreams, preventing completed changes—including the CV payload\nreduction—from reaching users.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"820b1fb54bea554295d6de0695525aac6fc45571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/820b1fb54bea554295d6de0695525aac6fc45571"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/d76803fadd5f0d5d63a9ebf889bc9d34bbf894ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 820b1fb54bea554295d6de0695525aac6fc45571\nparent a5bd455065d506d0a9728ff6a48ad5e63c4045d2\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1788055937 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788055937 +0000\n\nfix(hooks): let the pre-push visual guard build its review gallery as a non-root user (#98)\n\n## What\n\nRun visual pre-push captures as the invoking user and automatically\nreclaim stale, unwritable capture output, allowing review galleries to\nbuild while preserving the drift-blocking guard.\n\n## Why\n\nThe ownership mismatch was refusing publication across unrelated\nworkstreams, preventing completed changes—including the CV payload\nreduction—from reaching users.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqk5GBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqrUQAG4STMDyBDOVY37XqBtb2Age\npxU74ZI262fOjm1h0wMuEGLYjlq2PFEegtoe/qZtzjqeTftFYRf+QREmn+Vw5yIB\nsIYs7snKER0ytGlDCjbrLcndKv9C1KFjkjTeqFLLjSnuyO+twPCd6ftG5Phk8CFP\nta7aGlXSkAN+wdzlqtdhYSJfzkvZe7uhBmjAMLOwCeT+wjDI8IkWsyR2mpUYH4WZ\nAuD45t0YE/u0lYTKEikcoKdEdaUyLZHUuY+8eMp7RI+yDFh+sMKlfdZb4/sLpKQv\nzdoZK9WzNfSelIjGvkWyScTzKO7bnHGqpNrAmCnO9GKPWwGJGGC2D+6L3SsaVBkf\n0l/4vvHZWT4BDRthBzL3a9sb4H5AiuXMnCKGWNPnPoCXmYcXuS/FFjV4