pi.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/52c20dc49778d8714c0292791647ea9ce1ef8eb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:01:55Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T12:01:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"perf(nx): key each cached target on the files its command reads (#80)\n\n## What\n\nAlign Nx cache keys and task dependencies with the files and composed\nartifacts each target actually consumes, so changes rerun only the\nrequired work. Cache-keying and publish-lane coverage now remains\ndeterministic on empty caches and shallow CI checkouts.\n\n## Why\n\nA one-line app edit currently costs 1m48s through the slowest gate leg,\nincluding 44s of discarded build cache, while a one-rule `biome.json`\nedit costs 2m32s across projects that never read it. Project-owned\ninputs and dependencies provide the correct foundation for the remaining\nperformance work.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1a622bb1c9897d9a89ee62a7f495f8d866c464cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/1a622bb1c9897d9a89ee62a7f495f8d866c464cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/52c20dc49778d8714c0292791647ea9ce1ef8eb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a622bb1c9897d9a89ee62a7f495f8d866c464cc\nparent c8407b1b98a081dfddd2582cd373dbd866185893\naut