ith uncached screenshot and browser coverage\n\n## Verification\n- `just check-all`\n- `just lint-llm-diff` (16 passed, 0 failed)\n- `NX_BASE=origin/master NX_HEAD=HEAD just gate`\n- pre-push pinned-container capture: all 12 affected microfrontends\nunchanged against baselines\n\nSupersedes #36, #37, #41, #43, and #46.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"1ae0e8372444a559a024c8bc9b8e41c94d589c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/1ae0e8372444a559a024c8bc9b8e41c94d589c1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/82b6815c3c6c44129529621e5a8a87de5d4f2159","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ae0e8372444a559a024c8bc9b8e41c94d589c1b\nparent 6bddc6d8e1747714a9397bd6d75265d401bd7a8e\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1785044019 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785044019 +0000\n\nfeat(ssr): land deterministic federated hydration (#47)\n\n## Summary\n- hydrate source-rendered TanStack Router routes across the shell and\nstandalone remotes\n- preserve per-app loading skeletons and recover loader failures without\nReact hydration errors\n- make prerender and visual capture deterministic and validate\nserialized/artifact boundaries\n- harden the full gate with uncached screenshot and browser coverage\n\n## Verification\n- `just check-all`\n- `just lint-llm-diff` (16 passed, 0 failed)\n- `NX_BASE=origin/master NX_HEAD=HEAD just gate`\n- pre-push pinned-container capture: all 12 affected microfrontends\nunchanged against baselines\n\nSupersedes #36, #37, #41, #43, and #46.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZZwzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA578QAKnhK/Kg6TxDndCYqwNtGrZ2\n4PecoKQsf5rg5bsZuv4d6kMFxUntqfjDw4YK2tGZ/3LdGxxvMNa1uc804a+XRts8\nS5xciPLXNkP+tVwKx/T8uPTyzgiRYix4JuA773GXpBwc