er}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/39e2dc1bdbcf1fdf33b5406253abc57b47955839/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:17:32Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T04:17:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(perf): trustworthy lighthouse comparison suite (#40)\n\n## What\nAdd a pinned, URL-overridable Lighthouse performance-comparison suite\n(`scripts/performance-audit.mjs`, `performance.config.json`) that\ncompares the new github.io deployment against the original\nnickderobertis.com, with an explicit desktop throttling profile and\nmedian-of-N timings so the numbers are trustworthy (host-dependent\ntimings caveated; byte/CLS deltas stable). Also hardens the `serve-e2e`\nteardown (no lingering port-4301 listener) for a deterministic gate.\n\n## Why\nQuantifies the performance impact of the Module-Federation rewrite vs\nthe original site with a repeatable, methodology-corrected measurement\ninstead of the earlier throttled-in-a-sandbox artifacts.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"8576ba728c2cda983ca58fd97ac33bd763c8ce6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/8576ba728c2cda983ca58fd97ac33bd763c8ce6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/39e2dc1bdbcf1fdf33b5406253abc57b47955839","verification":{"payload":"tree 8576ba728c2cda983ca58fd97ac33bd763c8ce6b\nparent 46dee7606c3b88d73276437a5d19e8436fde227d\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784866652 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784866652 -0600\n\nfeat(perf): trustworthy lighthouse comparison suite (#40)\n\n## What\nAdd a pinned, URL-overridable Lighthouse performance-comparison suite\n(`scripts/performance-audit.mjs`, `performance.config.json`) that\ncompares the new github.io deployment against the original\nnickderobertis.com, with an explicit desktop throttling profile and\nmedian-of-N timings so the numbers are trustworthy (host-dependent\ntimings caveated; byte/CLS deltas stable). Also hardens the `serve-e2e`\nteardown (no lingering port-4301 listener) for a deterministic gate.\n\n## Why\nQuantifies the performance impact of the Module-Federation rewrite vs\nthe original site with a repeatable, methodology-corrected measurement\ninstead of the earlier throttled-in-a-sandbox artifacts.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYudcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA64wQAA4Mhz0gLa7wBN/Cl453b4qn\nQWZcAlXNhV6P1iZvFaQhQDF38Tb+5QZPWl8NbYRdBtHOqacgnY5MTzhEl9pS1fqK\n9Q3H7ss/4iZTvPtkI8Vis8LUCOmNSNOmMuLaX/PMM36SgU06uP5eY6zfveEuASJo\nlhBufzL1dNMbhNi7PxTVa/3qprSviHoY/67CbIvXEgMur5KkgrtEpds6/lIUB51P\nxc67xMdnBvrFdDwC6mvjHsxNkBn+/39SH82jdlMq5jQD1YT/oL+J+Xkoi6HRjAmL\nmhYbMWlobxff+3VfUV8KTHODpOQvH8mshU01Os/ew8YtAPYd5ifHNoW/iic0WBPR\nH5cleS5OVo6A8Hmm4VnFHujF0B13emofnR2Xda6IUnyX3SIzDrxheVYepyyFopJj\nxCFzT/vpvnI5DEwB