rl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/46dee7606c3b88d73276437a5d19e8436fde227d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:13:51Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T01:13:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(libs): remove domain coupling from shared libs (#39)\n\n## What\nExtend the affected-only economics fix to the presentation/shared libs:\nmove `AwardEmblem` out of `design-system` into the awards domain,\nrelocate feature-specific styles out of `design-system/theme.css` (~885\nlines) into their owning layers, remove the dead `analytics` and `ui`\nlibs, tighten Nx tags/boundaries, and add `docs/lib-coupling-report.md`.\n\n## Why\nDomain-specific code in shared libs (e.g. AwardEmblem in design-system)\nsilently defeats the affected-only test economics — an awards-only\nchange re-tested every remote. This restores per-feature isolation for\nthe presentation layer too.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"c9880542a0f835b36fa54515dd00227ad4bc230a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/c9880542a0f835b36fa54515dd00227ad4bc230a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/46dee7606c3b88d73276437a5d19e8436fde227d","verification":{"payload":"tree c9880542a0f835b36fa54515dd00227ad4bc230a\nparent 7b5a6513879420de8dc3a4b79dd922104629cf70\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784769231 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784769231 -0600\n\nrefactor(libs): remove domain coupling from shared libs (#39)\n\n## What\nExtend the affected-only economics fix to the presentation/shared libs:\nmove `AwardEmblem` out of `design-system` into the awards domain,\nrelocate feature-specific styles out of `design-system/theme.css` (~885\nlines) into their owning layers, remove the dead `analytics` and `ui`\nlibs, tighten Nx tags/boundaries, and add `docs/lib-coupling-report.md`.\n\n## Why\nDomain-specific code in shared libs (e.g. AwardEmblem in design-system)\nsilently defeats the affected-only test economics — an awards-only\nchange re-tested every remote. This restores per-feature isolation for\nthe presentation layer too.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYWrPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAldsQAJC+fe9Fb6FWmDZm1gr++r7P\nZsW2nElPval2jXZ53HW5M4dF1lmzNeNlvzMRFs0DwleAzQrVbQ9g0+G5aqBUi1cj\nCheC34dTYIb5Km14LMqy3D03mATM5UpKKOevz8rYELRT7A2I4YhruTQ9vAFw13tZ\nQH6j2MT8wLQkfUtGdtn2GoDSTgE/Rv7RSgGVWhJtsgg/cicwOXj6z12Y4lwB7/+d\nK3ND7W9UtxGilVAexZQ4ptsNz1/0kisV3+ud1LeRkie8qOUVlUh4WoT08wfKJb8/\nxogDTP1OcMr