d domain libraries\n- guard the CV domain contract against `cv.schema.json` drift\n- validate schema and data boundaries and preserve affected-build\neconomics evidence\n\n## Verification\n\n- `just check`\n- `just lint`\n- `just lint-llm-diff` (26 passed, 0 failed)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"acec0d7f7fdc089f1d21ab8815d16d0fc1258d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/acec0d7f7fdc089f1d21ab8815d16d0fc1258d6c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/c5314931844a95b66a18c70aae2c5b6ccbc7ba14","verification":{"payload":"tree acec0d7f7fdc089f1d21ab8815d16d0fc1258d6c\nparent 1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784683728 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784683728 +0000\n\nrefactor(data): split feature data access libraries (#34)\n\n## Summary\n\n- split feature data access into Nx-enforced domain libraries\n- guard the CV domain contract against `cv.schema.json` drift\n- validate schema and data boundaries and preserve affected-build\neconomics evidence\n\n## Verification\n\n- `just check`\n- `just lint`\n- `just lint-llm-diff` (26 passed, 0 failed)\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqYBzQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxxgQAIpNLRPiIMNeO0/PM0eANhdv\nE4ze12zASM8xEQ1BHvtzDe25dyYxfEObToGSPQCNV3xmJbjUA8Q1sO04383Kc+Iy\nJagruId6JeyxN2JpDok+d5/+sbWUER05yXeTVbTq67l8Dg0XCLQG/SDErBs3QiKQ\nOci64Y39DoAKcsZHam8mL6GObT9+bhTdH7vzdDq44K6vmUBJytdF7sOOdgb6/HBL\nuja9cqMSngGrtG7/kxySGR6AT2FpCHRi1hjckcUmZzN3LQjd/e6VdNA4EnSO7vkf\nmWskj9CPKB8Lo9rmlXNwvAvVsZntTkBHmpN92YGuLnfHIhJEwqfgQtPddJXSbyke\nBE/T86PGlS+ic4+34U5Y9SlGBpXDgpf65tp7WrvtqcZX5J26YtSdrI13Fra/uuBc\nE1F26i4wFD+ImzCWGZUn7CqE80INlJ+3H9exuIpyiwyAONlfpykBduQYFlRqnH4D\n4s25htYkcHceYtWNns6mtEhlnJHgvBBLjmZbsFYUal7ANsb3y75vKNMTropu/Rlj\nLn0FmIR36Q3WzMnx/hHOVB8izTJvxNemiNL48U6t5x/vAh8K4Fs5HwQBjX0ivHgU\ntvvR6O8WeHYsfaeI1u/d92JIhr3qOttWToW0eoO5WMIfZu7BbaReAz0oKc2kX84F\njZIiOOYsI/FPq0YDTd8x\n=rWDD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-22T01:28:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/c5314931844a95b66a18c70aae2c5b6ccbc7ba14","node_id":"C_kwDOEVh7ZNoAKGM1MzE0OTMxODQ0YTk1YjY2YTE4YzcwYWFlMmM1YjZjY2JjN2JhMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266","sha":"1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266"}],"sha":"c5314931844a95b66a18c70aae2c5b6ccbc7ba14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/c5314931844a95b66a18c70aae2c5b6ccbc7ba14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:42:36Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T19:42:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(llmlint): cap judge batch_size to prevent JSON overflow (#32)\n\n## What\nAdd an `agents` block to `llmlint.yml` that caps the default judge\nagent''s `batch_size` at 5 (down from the built-in default of 20). Insert\nit immediately before the top-level `rules:` key:\n\n```yaml\nagents:\n  # Cap rules per judge run: the default (20) packed every diff-wide rule into\n  # one call whose combined verdict+rationale output overran the judge and\n  # returned no parseable JSON on large changesets. Smaller batches keep each\n  # call''s output within budget. Harness/model left unset to preserve oneharness fallback.\n  default:\n    batch_size: 5\n```\n\nDo NOT set `harness` or `model` (leave them unset so the oneharness\nfallback still selects them). Change nothing else.\n\n## Why\nllmlint''s default `batch_size: 20` groups every applicable rule into a\nsingle judge call; with `rationales: true`, the model must emit a\nverdict AND rationale for ~20 rules in one response. On a wide changeset\nthat combined output overruns the judge and llmlint reports `no JSON\nvalue could be extracted from the response`, erroring `lint-llm-diff`\n(exit 2) with ZERO real findings. This deterministically blocks every\nlarge change in this repo (it stalled the data-lib split across multiple\nfull retries). Smaller batches keep each call''s output within budget so\nthe judge returns parseable JSON. Verified: with batch_size 5 the same\ndiff that errored now completes and the judge emits real verdicts.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"0610e52b77587d5ef6288f61516411f1c6d83423","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/0610e52b77587d5ef6288f61516411f1c6d83423"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/1dce7d772133e0aefcc889f57cd01db309b09266","verification":{"payload":"tree 0610e52b77587d5ef6288f61516411f1c6d83423\nparent 067a2c5f3558ce3a7ef5ed2bbd4d45336a421353\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784662956 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784662956 +0000\n\nfix(llmlint): cap judge batch_size to prevent JSON overflow (#32)\n\n## What\nAdd an `agents` block to `llmlint.yml` that caps the default judge\nagent''s `batch_size` at 5 (down from the built-in default of 20). Insert\nit immediately before the top-level `rules:` key:\n\n```yaml\nagents:\n  # Cap rules per judge run: the default (20) packed every diff-wide rule into\n  # one call whose combined verdict+rationale output overran the judge and\n  # returned no parseable JSON on large changesets. Smaller batches keep each\n  # call''s output within budget. Harness/model left unset to preserve oneharness fallback.\n  default:\n    batch_size: 5\n```\n\nDo NOT set `harness` or `model` (leave them unset so the oneharness\nfallback still selects them). Change nothing else.\n\n## Why\nllmlint''s default `batch_size: 20` groups every applicable rule into a\nsingle judge call; with `rationales: true`, the model must emit a\nverdict AND rationale for ~20 rules in one response. On a wide changeset\nthat combined output overruns the judge and llmlint reports `no JSON\nvalue could be extracted from the response`, erroring `lint-llm-diff`\n(exit 2) with ZERO real findings. This deterministically blocks every\nlarge change in this repo (it stalled the data-lib split across multiple\nfull retries). Smaller batches keep each call''s output within budget so\nthe judge returns parseable JSON. Verified: with batch_size 5 the same\ndiff that errored now completes and the judge emits real verdicts.\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX8usCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAyjMQAJe0Pau+p6Z14iFucaXbcJC6\nPCWw1I8kqFm7OQIPgZANEINxiiI397JtDxfDk5QoTSRrrvg1YkC2M2PTCFtNUtDO\nzaNNWUqh9x+rYQjleWBuAbqIrzaMhCDO9I4oMyfEp2ojbw2kmndj5mRmx53cHarM\nfkURgxaL9h1nGMEXKHNlBdzFwVOzydphDymhTC87UfnOMrSHCHFW85DHpuNYPVdo\nRfL+ZJCIkU8Pzv9OvxXj946IsMPk+7IBPoHTyCdPUjgq1YO+YVNMQepclx1T3mnS\nNmFOypvE7VTLa+swDJ7xOKS2SiUPginvKkvk56vz8ZsMf0lENTVbLhpttEXVRJ3k\nuImrQk08yTCJ5Oli/uxZJFTEYvXwF+ahAw8eUvH7s/y2Bhhsq6jS3MZRD2ZMNdVP\nb0plP4GLoMlBYQ1KUS3/A0t2cUr0f43rkzCmToC4YkYYcvNkoZcctCNw87M7PKlL\nVzVB+rhJ+HxvwqqM2XX7ATHYVr+9e3t+B2Qdl24A08H4oDReG4zWz4ZF3BGqAN7D\nNH9xwi2Zcw3ngdwnhANbFQ52g4HDXLqoY2nYxszTiSKB/CmIKctHf3gYO5BqUDT0\nvSbSB3iKP0r1BcbcUXfljcG+mjy+I7mf9Ooa7nETv4GXy/z6gLcA5U6zKGChtQi0\nl+1oSxYufToI1K55TGSH\n=4R0z\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-21T19:42:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events