:"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/067a2c5f3558ce3a7ef5ed2bbd4d45336a421353/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:00:35Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T11:00:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: architecture, e2e journey inventory, and README closeout (#31)\n\n## What\nCloseout docs for the rewritten site: AGENTS.md stack-and-composition +\nenumerated e2e journey inventory, a docs/architecture.md covering the\nomnidirectional Module-Federation design, shared-lib boundaries, GitHub\nPages static/prerender/404 hosting, the killed-API/build-time-data\nmodel, and the affected-only test economics; README refresh; and a just\nrecipe to run the site interactively.\n\n## Why\nDurable documentation of the new architecture and the growing e2e\njourney contract.\n\n## Additional info\nThe node''s local `just check` failed only on a flaky e2e web-server port\nconflict (127.0.0.1:4301 already in use by a concurrent run) — an infra\nflake, not a docs/code issue. Docs-only changes do not affect e2e\nbehavior.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"58f8b9956e072ec4681eb8711f4ad68dbb98956e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/58f8b9956e072ec4681eb8711f4ad68dbb98956e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/067a2c5f3558ce3a7ef5ed2bbd4d45336a421353","verification":{"payload":"tree 58f8b9956e072ec4681eb8711f4ad68dbb98956e\nparent 34c909e93a24571a2ed825bc75c5120ecf1aa340\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784631635 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784631635 -0600\n\ndocs: architecture, e2e journey inventory, and README closeout (#31)\n\n## What\nCloseout docs for the rewritten site: AGENTS.md stack-and-composition +\nenumerated e2e journey inventory, a docs/architecture.md covering the\nomnidirectional Module-Federation design, shared-lib boundaries, GitHub\nPages static/prerender/404 hosting, the killed-API/build-time-data\nmodel, and the affected-only test economics; README refresh; and a just\nrecipe to run the site interactively.\n\n## Why\nDurable documentation of the new architecture and the growing e2e\njourney contract.\n\n## Additional info\nThe node''s local `just check` failed only on a flaky e2e web-server port\nconflict (127.0.0.1:4301 already in use by a concurrent run) — an infra\nflake, not a docs/code issue. Docs-only changes do not affect e2e\nbehavior.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX1FTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3hoQAEpBX+/qgMbG1szaCXEIEsuV\nLZ3mUFp9NsnOcTeIVkJkJOqRIC9yN3cC0mjX74kg3k8dh2LGJf7t7TbZsgOP/dNI\nL3U7NE/+wsOOx1hWr2Rna5tTAibGUvUaXh+4YHcUe8m4UYuKP8LWAgXh0CYQkOa7\ngW1bmfUPwtr/vr07fZwDU/pyu2PrshsFnsFntKpe5+PXYKoy5S8HiUsRfbgwthKq\n/nF0Q8hGK+EgVY/uv72chCGkflLODsata6JFG0c4mp3TpnIpfscR3r0W2tWAVHqY\ngsX57IpiDxNYnIVttCrSm9UgWQ7kUE2kScdOw54k5eaJ+5qDJOgeClbLkRUMSwtv\naP8wSQ6MSzdpeluI9X71tA+WayXngTrUy0pnwFkhjR+nUbpyyxzjq3IhH3D4jxIu\n47cNxt4htgiOxi8zgDBBZsrbHSMXAjSxEfQnDDgzBrOBbQ5SCahOpkwopJ+RGPVu\nDy6zbtlYP248SyZYU3Nvj3xqR7/D4NDAsTyZRL+pxvST2N5C9D44aBImqvB7VPm4\n3pwjWK5NRtNiO1wdreCg7iA+ZPxRZ8d3CFMhodFCPmx2IRv3iIPtov