.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/34c909e93a24571a2ed825bc75c5120ecf1aa340/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:09:03Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T10:09:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(integration): verify composed site + affected-only e2e economics (#30)\n\n## What\nIntegration verification of the composed federated site: static Pages\nbuild + deep-links/prerender (SSG of substantive route content), browser\njourneys scoped by remote owner (the affected-only e2e economics),\nscreencomp visual-drift verified against a same-CPU baseline, and\nstatic/e2e boundary validation.\n\n## Why\nCapstone verification that the omnidirectional Module-Federation site\ncomposes correctly and that nx-affected scopes tests to only the changed\nremotes / their dependents.\n\n## Additional info\nFunctional gate (`just check`: nx affected\ntest/e2e/build/prerender/screenshot, biome, actionlint, shellcheck,\ntypecheck) is green. One llmlint judge finding remains on this change —\ntracked as a follo