 microfrontend (#27)\n\n## What\nImplement the AWARDS microfrontend as a Module Federation remote with\nits own Nx boundary: the awards pane and award cards (received date,\nextra info, award parts) and the awards stats, sourcing awards from the\ndata-access lib, including the selected-awards subset used on the home\npage. Match reference/screenshots/ via design-system. Comprehensive\nPlaywright e2e for every scenario: all-awards vs selected-awards render,\nan award with/without extra info/parts, stats, empty/error, responsive,\nstandalone + host-composed. Satisfy the stricter e2e and\naggressive-split llmlint rules.\n\n## Why\nDispatched by ai-orchestrator (persona: `engineer`, 2 agent turn(s)),\nverified locally and driven to green checks before merge.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"8a160a6b9b4cfb2f1e07d6e49d6f1f0dcf11da66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/8a160a6b9b4cfb2f1e07d6e49d6f1f0dcf11da66"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/8fa70b009d875414af0c08cc12a54fda8969e85c","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a160a6b9b4cfb2f1e07d6e49d6f1f0dcf11da66\nparent 54bac7f9daa90c9a66627a2be7c3b5ed72331d12\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784588975 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784588975 +0000\n\nfeat(awards): awards microfrontend (#27)\n\n## What\nImplement the AWARDS microfrontend as a Module Federation remote with\nits own Nx boundary: the awards pane and award cards (received date,\nextra info, award parts) and the awards stats, sourcing awards from the\ndata-access lib, including the selected-awards subset used on the home\npage. Match reference/screenshots/ via design-system. Comprehensive\nPlaywright e2e for every scenario: all-awards vs selected-awards render,\nan award with/without extra info/parts, stats, empty/error, responsive,\nstandalone + host-composed. Satisfy