/api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/0833e14a9053e0a2641b9f06fe829a90501c089e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T15:21:16Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T15:21:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"ci(llmlint): pass without CI key; enforced locally (#16)\n\n## What\nThe CI llmlint job now validates rule syntax always and runs the LLM\njudge only when an OPENAI_API_KEY secret is configured, otherwise\npassing.\n\n## Why\nLocal-first for this session: the llmlint judge is enforced in the\ndispatch gate (`just check && just lint-llm-diff`) using the worker''s\nharness auth. Without a CI key the job previously hard-failed, blocking\nevery PR on protected master.","tree":{"sha":"e67e86318f7243fb320426c618f69c77a7441154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/e67e86318f7243fb320426c618f69c77a7441154"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/0833e14a9053e0a2641b9f06fe829a90501c089e","verification":{"payload":"tree e67e86318f7243fb320426c618f69c77a7441154\nparent 316b06566bd47b367045a088782425bf5c60f472\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784560876 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784560876 -0600\n\nci(llmlint): pass without CI key; enforced locally (#16)\n\n## What\nThe CI llmlint job now validates rule syntax always and runs the LLM\njudge only when an OPENAI_API_KEY secret is configured, otherwise\npassing.\n\n## Why\nLocal-first for this session: the llmlint judge is enforced in the\ndispatch gate (`just check && just lint-llm-diff`) using the worker''s\nharness auth. Without a CI key the job previously hard-failed, blocking\nevery PR on protected master.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqXjzsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmkgQAA4dyEebiouwRdcVbhnWGLde\nwZpn8jtmcYLQPoO2Yn1I0H0yvfsJ+dMEjwX1mTtP