mJkNDdiMzY3MDQ1YTA4ODc4MjQyNWJmNWM2MGY0NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commit/8021cdb9121150a0dd48d5a9dc66a2de5c96fe24","sha":"8021cdb9121150a0dd48d5a9dc66a2de5c96fe24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/8021cdb9121150a0dd48d5a9dc66a2de5c96fe24"}],"sha":"316b06566bd47b367045a088782425bf5c60f472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/316b06566bd47b367045a088782425bf5c60f472"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","id":19440155,"login":"nickderobertis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/commits/8021cdb9121150a0dd48d5a9dc66a2de5c96fe24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T11:45:29Z","email":"whoopnip@gmail.com","name":"Nick DeRobertis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T11:45:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat!: scaffold Nx + rspack + React module-federation monorepo (#13)\n\n## What\nStart this repository''s local files FRESH per the create-repo\nconventions, replacing the Angular+FastAPI tree with an Nx + rspack +\nReact + omnidirectional Module Federation monorepo, retaining ONLY the\noutward behavior of the old site. Use the create-repo skill''s composer\n(uv run --script <create-repo>/scripts/compose_repo_plan.py --shape\nreact --language typescript --monorepo, plus --llmlint-config to compose\nllmlint.yml + oneharness.toml) and follow the emitted plan. Deliver in\nTHIS node: (1) the agent layer (AGENTS.md + CLAUDE.md symlink + narrow\n.claude/settings.json + session-setup hook) with the composition\nrecorded in the Stack-and-composition section; (2) the Nx workspace with\npnpm (document in AGENTS.md why pnpm over bun: rspack Module\nFederation), one command surface via just\n(bootstrap/check/test/lint/format/upgrade) where `just check` runs `nx\naffected` lint+typecheck+test+build+e2e; (3) an rspack Module Federation\n2.0 HOST/shell app that owns routing for the five routes (`/` home,\n`bio`, `research`, `software`, `courses`), header, nav, footer, and\ncomposes remotes, configured omnidirectionally (remotes may both expose\nand consume) with pinned publicPath for a GitHub Pages base href of\n/nick-derobertis-site/; (4) the shared Nx libraries as skeletons with\nenforced tag/module boundaries: `design-system` (modern design tokens +\ntheming derived from the old Bootstrap look and the\nreference/screenshots baseline, retaining a similar look and feel),\n`data-access` (a typed client over the derobertis-cv TS package\n`@nickderobertis/cv-data`, exposing the six data domains from its\n`/data` JSON + root types + `/schema`, REPLACING all former FastAPI\nrouters; PREFER the published npm package, but if it is not yet on the\nregistry -- the derobertis-cv release CI is being repaired -- consume it\nvia a git dependency on nickderobertis/derobertis-cv or by vendoring its\ncommitted `codegen/` JSON+types, and leave a TODO to switch to the npm\ndep once published), `analytics` (the gtag event system), `layout`\n(header/footer/nav), and `ui` primitives; (5) a GitHub Pages deploy\nworkflow that builds the host + all remotes statically to fixed\nsubpaths, prerenders routes at build time (SSG) for SEO parity, adds a\n404.html SPA deep-link fallback, and deploys to the github.io PROJECT\nURL (base href /nick-derobertis-site/) NOT the custom domain, so the old\nAWS-hosted site stays live at nickderobertis.com; (6) CI (nx affected\ngate + a separate llmlint job) and branch protection via the create-repo\ngovernance script; (7) DELETE the Angular app, the FastAPI backend\n(nick_derobertis_site/), AWS CDK/deploy, Dockerfile, and all API code.\nRETAIN reference/screenshots/. The result of this node is an\nempty-but-working shell: no feature remotes implemented yet, just the\nhost rendering placeholder routes and the shared-lib skeletons\nresolving. Prove it: `just check` green, the host builds and prerenders,\nand the Pages workflow deploys the shell.\n\n## Why\nDispatched by ai-orchestrator (persona: `engineer`, 3 agent turn(s)),\nverified locally and driven to green checks before merge.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: nick <nick@U-17UN402ICR95C.workspaces.hellopatient.internal>","tree":{"sha":"b779915fe9ea8cdd05fae463de80ca3ccb2f09a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/trees/b779915fe9ea8cdd05fae463de80ca3ccb2f09a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/nick-derobertis-site/git/commits/8021cdb9121150a0dd48d5a9dc66a2de5c96fe24","verification":{"payload":"tree b779915fe9ea8cdd05fae463de80ca3ccb2f09a0\nparent c7fe035def8913a2455464bd62d907fcf795cbf2\nauthor Nick DeRobertis <whoopnip@gmail.com> 1784547929 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784547929 -0600\n\nfeat!: scaffold Nx + rspack + React module-federation monorepo (#13)\n\n## What\nStart this repository''s local files FRESH per the create-repo\nconventions, replacing the Angular+FastAPI tree with an Nx + rspack +\nReact + omnidirectional Module Federation monorepo, retaining ONLY the\noutward behavior of the old site. Use the create-repo skill''s composer\n(uv run --script <create-repo>/scripts/compose_repo_plan.py --shape\nreact --language typescript --monorepo, plus --llmlint-config to compose\nllmlint.yml + oneharness.toml) and follow the emitted plan. Deliver in\nTHIS node: (1) the agent layer (AGENTS.md + CLAUDE.md symlink + narrow\n.claude/settings.json + session-setup hook) with the composition\nrecorded in the Stack-and-composition section; (2) the Nx workspace with\npnpm (document in AGENTS.md why pnpm over bun: rspack Module\nFederation), one command surface via just\n(bootstrap/check/test/lint/format/upgrade) where `just check` runs `nx\naffected` lint+typecheck+test+build+e2e; (3) an rspack Module Federation\n2.0 HOST/shell app that owns routing for the five routes (`/` home,\n`bio`, `research`, `software`, `courses`), header, nav, footer, and\ncomposes remotes, configured omnidirectionally (remotes may both expose\nand consume) with pinned publicPath for a GitHub Pages base href of\n/nick-derobertis-site/; (4) the shared Nx libraries as skeletons with\nenforced tag/module boundaries: `design-system` (modern design tokens +\ntheming derived from the old Bootstrap look and the\nreference/screenshots baseline, retaining a similar look and feel),\n`data-access` (a typed client over the derobertis-cv TS package\n`@nickderobertis/cv-data`, exposing the six data domains from its\n`/data` JSON + root types + `/schema`, REPLACING all former FastAPI\nrouters; PREFER the published npm package, but if it is not yet on the\nregistry -- the derobertis-cv release CI is being repaired -- consume it\nvia a git dependency on nickderobertis/derobertis-cv or by vendoring its\ncommitted `codegen/` JSON+types, and leave a TODO to switch to the npm\ndep once published), `analytics` (the gtag event system), `layout`\n(header/footer/nav), and `ui` primitives; (5) a GitHub Pages deploy\nworkflow 